{"slug":"docuwriter-ai","name":"DocuWriter.ai","description":"DocuWriter.ai is an AI-powered platform for creating and managing complete, structured documentation for entire codebases. Teams can connect repositories and generate documentation covering architecture, modules, services, classes, functions, dependencies, APIs, diagrams, READMEs, and other technical components. It supports both individual repositories and larger multi-repository systems.","icon":"https://stuff.thingsofbrand.com/docuwriter.ai/images/img3_docuwriter.png","domain":"docuwriter.ai","rank":263,"labels":["Developer Tools","Engineering","Documentation"],"categories":["developer-tools","documents"],"eventsRead":true,"events":[{"n":"Create Space","d":"Create a new documentation space and optionally set its description, public visibility, and URL slug.","t":"action","k":"hook"},{"n":"List Spaces","d":"Retrieve all documentation Spaces available to the authenticated user","t":"action","k":"hook"},{"n":"Create Document","d":"Create a document in a space with title and content; optionally set parent folder by ID or folder path and specify the document type.","t":"action","k":"hook"},{"n":"List Documents in a Space","d":"Retrieve documents from a specified Space.","t":"action","k":"hook"},{"n":"Generate UML Diagram","d":"Create a UML diagram from source code.","t":"action","k":"hook"},{"n":"Generate Inline Comments and DocBlocks","d":"Add inline comments and DocBlocks to source code.","t":"action","k":"hook"},{"n":"Generate Code Documentation","d":"Generate AI-powered documentation for a source code file","t":"action","k":"hook"},{"n":"List My Generations","d":"Fetch documentation generations with pagination and type filtering","t":"action","k":"hook"},{"n":"List Repositories","d":"Show all Git repositories connected to your DocuWriter.ai account.","t":"action","k":"hook"},{"n":"Update Document","d":"Update the title or content of an existing document in a Space","t":"action","k":"hook"},{"n":"Search D